  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375\u00181 \u001086C.",
    "Place the kombu in a cold-extract process to remove its gelatinous properties.",
    "Chop the onion, ginger, and garlic.",
    "Sauté the onion, ginger, and garlic in olive oil until softened.",
    "Add the spices and stir for 1 minute.",
    "Add the ackee and stir to combine with the spice mixture.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a Dutch oven and roast for 20 minutes.",
    "Remove the kombu cold-extract and stir into the mixture.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Serve warm."
